<h1 style="font-size:36px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 8px;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Data Deletion</h1>
<p style="color:#71717a;font-size:14px;margin:0 0 48px">Last Updated: January 1, 2026</p>

<p>This page explains how to request deletion of personal data that TheClaws ("Company," "we," "us," or "our") processes on the OpenClaw platform, including data associated with WhatsApp Business messaging handled on behalf of our business clients. TheClaws uses the WhatsApp Business API provided by Meta Platforms, Inc. and processes messages on behalf of connected businesses.</p>

<h2 style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;margin:48px 0 16px">1. Who Can Request Deletion</h2>
<ul style="padding-left:20px">
<li><strong>Account Holders:</strong> Business users with a TheClaws account may request deletion of their account data and the data of WhatsApp Business accounts they have connected to our platform.</li>
<li><strong>End Users:</strong> If you have messaged a business that uses our platform via WhatsApp and wish to have your data deleted, you may submit a request using the method below. Because TheClaws processes message data on behalf of the business, we may also forward your request to the connected business.</li>
</ul>

<h2 style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;margin:48px 0 16px">2. How to Request Deletion</h2>
<p>To request deletion of your data, email us at <a href="mailto:support@theclaws.ai?subject=Data%20Deletion%20Request" style="color:#000;font-weight:600">support@theclaws.ai</a> with the subject line <strong>"Data Deletion Request"</strong> and include:</p>
<ul style="padding-left:20px">
<li>Your full name</li>
<li>The email address associated with your TheClaws account (if applicable)</li>
<li>The WhatsApp phone number the request relates to (if applicable)</li>
<li>The name of the business whose WhatsApp account the request relates to (if you are an end user)</li>
<li>A brief description of the data you want deleted (for example, all data, specific conversations, or a specific date range)</li>
</ul>
<p>We may ask for additional information to verify your identity before processing the request.</p>

<h2 style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;margin:48px 0 16px">3. What Data Will Be Deleted</h2>
<p>Upon a verified request, we will delete or irreversibly anonymise the following data stored on our systems:</p>
<ul style="padding-left:20px">
<li>Account profile information (name, email, login credentials)</li>
<li>WhatsApp Business account connection data and associated credentials</li>
<li>WhatsApp message content (incoming and outgoing) processed by our platform</li>
<li>Message metadata (timestamps, delivery status, conversation IDs) associated with your phone number or account</li>
<li>Customer phone numbers associated with your WhatsApp conversations</li>
<li>AI interaction data (inputs and outputs from OpenClaw agents) tied to the requester</li>
<li>Agent configurations and prompts you created</li>
<li>Support communications, where not required for legal or compliance purposes</li>
</ul>

<h2 style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;margin:48px 0 16px">4. What Data May Be Retained</h2>
<p>Certain data may be retained after a deletion request where we are legally required or permitted to do so, including:</p>
<ul style="padding-left:20px">
<li>Payment and billing records, retained for up to 7 years for tax and accounting compliance</li>
<li>Records needed to comply with legal, regulatory, or audit obligations</li>
<li>Aggregated or de-identified data that can no longer be linked to you</li>
<li>Information needed to detect or prevent fraud, abuse, or security incidents</li>
</ul>
<p>Data held by Meta or other third parties (for example, messages stored in the end user's own WhatsApp client) is outside of our control. You may need to contact those parties directly to request deletion of data on their systems.</p>

<h2 style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;margin:48px 0 16px">5. Processing Timeline</h2>
<p>We will acknowledge your request within 7 days of receipt and will complete verified deletion requests within 30 days. If a request is complex or requires additional time, we will notify you of the extension and the expected completion date.</p>

<h2 style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;margin:48px 0 16px">6. Self-Service Options for Account Holders</h2>
<ul style="padding-left:20px">
<li><strong>Delete an agent or conversation:</strong> You can delete individual agents, conversations, or configurations from within your OpenClaw dashboard.</li>
<li><strong>Disconnect a WhatsApp Business account:</strong> You can disconnect a WhatsApp Business account from within your dashboard, which immediately stops message processing for that account.</li>
<li><strong>Close your account:</strong> Closing your TheClaws account triggers deletion of account data and associated agent data after the 30-day grace period described in our <a href="/terms" style="color:#000;font-weight:600">Terms of Service</a>.</li>
</ul>

<h2 style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;margin:48px 0 16px">7. Related Policies</h2>
<p>For more detail on how we collect, use, and protect your data, see our <a href="/privacy" style="color:#000;font-weight:600">Privacy Policy</a>. For the rules governing your use of the Service, see our <a href="/terms" style="color:#000;font-weight:600">Terms of Service</a>.</p>

<h2 style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;margin:48px 0 16px">8. Contact Us</h2>
<p>If you have questions about this page or need help with a deletion request, contact us at:</p>
<p><strong>TheClaws</strong><br/>Email: <a href="mailto:support@theclaws.ai" style="color:#000;font-weight:600">support@theclaws.ai</a><br/>Website: <a href="https://theclaws.ai" style="color:#000;font-weight:600">theclaws.ai</a></p>

